        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mine, mine, mine ...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've ventured into the depths of the caves with one goal—getting rich. Starting with nothing, you must race against time to meet your daily objectives by acquiring new gear and abilities. Discover powerful synergies between dozens of unique items and build your way to fortune!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621320/extras/a5f77b6971e2fb98953ab0f568c9ba45.poster.avif?t=1787079268\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621320/extras/a5f77b6971e2fb98953ab0f568c9ba45.webm?t=1787079268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621320/extras/a5f77b6971e2fb98953ab0f568c9ba45.mp4?t=1787079268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Race with time</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each day, you'll explore a randomly generated cave, trying to collect as much money as possible before time runs out. Anything you leave behind will be lost forever!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621320/extras/7c708990927c4950b80512d407339b89.poster.avif?t=1787079268\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621320/extras/7c708990927c4950b80512d407339b89.webm?t=1787079268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621320/extras/7c708990927c4950b80512d407339b89.mp4?t=1787079268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore multiple terrains</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through diverse biomes, each filled with unique resources and obstacles that challenge your path to wealth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621320/extras/5c264c20bc346e75be2da6025bbb81c0.avif?t=1787079268\" width=616 height=400 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Synergize your items</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with countless item combinations to create powerful synergies. Plan your builds, develop strategies, and do whatever it takes to achieve success!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mine, mine, mine ...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've ventured into the depths of the caves with one goal—getting rich. Starting with nothing, you must race against time to meet your daily objectives by acquiring new gear and abilities. Discover powerful synergies between dozens of unique items and build your way to fortune!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621320/extras/a5f77b6971e2fb98953ab0f568c9ba45.poster.avif?t=1787079268\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621320/extras/a5f77b6971e2fb98953ab0f568c9ba45.webm?t=1787079268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621320/extras/a5f77b6971e2fb98953ab0f568c9ba45.mp4?t=1787079268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Race with time</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each day, you'll explore a randomly generated cave, trying to collect as much money as possible before time runs out. Anything you leave behind will be lost forever!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621320/extras/7c708990927c4950b80512d407339b89.poster.avif?t=1787079268\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621320/extras/7c708990927c4950b80512d407339b89.webm?t=1787079268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621320/extras/7c708990927c4950b80512d407339b89.mp4?t=1787079268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore multiple terrains</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through diverse biomes, each filled with unique resources and obstacles that challenge your path to wealth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621320/extras/5c264c20bc346e75be2da6025bbb81c0.avif?t=1787079268\" width=616 height=400 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Synergize your items</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with countless item combinations to create powerful synergies. Plan your builds, develop strategies, and do whatever it takes to achieve success!</p>",
        "short_description": "Oreflux is a fast mining roguelite where you have to battle with time to fullfill your daily mission. Upgrade your gear, create synergies with dozens of unique items and become a millionaire!",
